        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical Packers And Movers Patna To Sitapur relocation take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard Patna‑to‑Sitapur move covers roughly 850 km and usually takes 2‑3 business days, depending on traffic, weather, and any scheduled stops for loading or customs checks. Our dedicated fleet follows the National Highway Arterial Corridors, ensuring minimal delays while maintaining safety and security of your belongings.</p>
