      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity shift from Patna to Sitapur?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a Patna to Sitapur relocation you’ll need a valid government‑issued ID, the original GST invoice issued by Shree Ashirwad Packers and Movers, a signed e‑Way bill for goods in transit, and any specific corporate or bank clearance letters if the move is reimbursable. All paperwork complies with IBA mover code regulations.</p>
