        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance included in the Packers And Movers Patna To Sitapur service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance at no extra cost. The policy protects against loss, theft, or damage during the entire 850‑km journey, and a claim can be filed directly through our support team using the provided insurance certificate.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my household goods in real time during the Patna‑Sitapur move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS units that feed live location data to a secure dashboard. Customers receive a unique tracking link via SMS and email, allowing you to monitor the exact position of your cargo from departure in Patna to delivery in Sitapur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad’s vehicle carrier service ideal for Patna to Sitapur relocations?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our two‑wheeler and car carriers feature hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and high‑tensile ratchet lashings, ensuring safe loading and unloading. The enclosed multi‑car trailers are GPS‑monitored and comply with ISO‑9001 standards, providing a damage‑free, secure transport solution for personal and corporate vehicles along the Patna‑Sitapur corridor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging system protect fragile items on the Patna‑Sitapur route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The 7‑layer system starts with a Polythene film wrap, followed by heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, stretch film, and finally custom wooden crates for extremely delicate pieces. Each layer adds shock absorption and moisture resistance, guaranteeing that glassware, electronics, and heirlooms arrive intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the Packers And Movers Patna To Sitapur tariff?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our tariff chart is fully transparent. The quoted price includes distance‑based freight, packing materials, insurance, and GST. Additional fees only arise for optional services such as disassembly of large furniture, extra stops, or expedited delivery. All extra costs are disclosed upfront before the move begins.</p>
